OL,3,GNEWSA'Strong support' for revamp of
OL,4,AInverness Station Quarter
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council says there is "very
OL,7,Fstrong support" from the public for its
OL,8,Fplans to make major changes to the area
OL,9,Faround Inverness bus station.
OL,11,FThe plans involve creating a
OL,12,Ftraffic-free civic square at Farraline
OL,13,FPark next to city's A-listed library
OL,14,Fbuilding.
OL,16,FMoving the bus station closer to the
OL,17,Frailway station to create an integrated
OL,18,Ftransport hub has also been proposed.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
