OL,3,GNEWSA'Strong support' for revamp of
OL,4,AInverness Station Quarter
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a new report, council officials said
OL,7,Fit could be a catalyst for wider
OL,8,Fregeneration of the area known as the
OL,9,FStation Quarter.
